  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yemen suffers from a severe weakness in the infrastructure as a result of the repercussions of the war that has been raging for nearly eight years, which made the effects of the floods deepen the tragedy of the population. A report issued by the UN Office in Yemen stated that &quot;preliminary reports issued by local authorities and humanitarian partners in Yemen indicate that 77 people,  including children, were killed as a result of rain and floods that hit 85 districts in 16 governorates</narrative>
